  "note": "whisper failed: URLError: <urlopen error Tunnel connection failed: 403 Forbidden>",
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Raat ek baje Kabir lauta, aur maa chillaayi, jaa, wapas mat aana!",
      "start": 0.15,
      "end": 3.975,
      "startFrame": 4,
      "endFrame": 119
    },
    {
      "text": "Woh shaam saat baje se gayab tha, kuch nahi bola, phir nikal gaya.",
      "start": 4.2,
      "end": 7.365,
      "startFrame": 126,
      "endFrame": 221
    },
    {
      "text": "Clue, maa ki BP ki dawai shaam ko khatam hui, aur mohalle ki dukaanein nau baje band hoti hain.",
      "start": 7.59,
      "end": 12.65,
      "startFrame": 228,
      "endFrame": 380
    },
    {
      "text": "Kabir ki jeb mein, saade baarah baje ka, dawai ka bill tha.",
      "start": 12.9,
      "end": 16.095,
      "startFrame": 387,
      "endFrame": 483
    },
    {
      "text": "Toh Kabir, chhe ghante, kahan tha?",
      "start": 16.26,
      "end": 18.555,
      "startFrame": 488,
      "endFrame": 557
    },
    {
      "text": "A, dawai ke liye, poora shehar ghoom raha tha.",
      "start": 18.81,
      "end": 21.345,
      "startFrame": 564,
      "endFrame": 640
    },
    {
      "text": "B, doston ke saath, party kar raha tha.",
      "start": 21.57,
      "end": 23.715,
      "startFrame": 647,
      "endFrame": 711
    },
    {
      "text": "C, office mein, overtime kar raha tha.",
      "start": 24.0,
      "end": 26.085,
      "startFrame": 720,
      "endFrame": 783
    },
    {
      "text": "D, kahin baith ke, game khel raha tha.",
      "start": 26.34,
      "end": 28.395,
      "startFrame": 790,
      "endFrame": 852
    },
    {
      "text": "Gusse ka ek shabd wapas nahi aata, comment karo, answer in the next reel, follow @yourhandle!",
      "start": 28.59,
      "end": 33.435,
      "startFrame": 858,
      "endFrame": 1003
    }
  ],
